  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "1. Martin weighs \\(57\\) kg.\n2. Carl weighs \\(57+18=75\\) kg.\n3. Let the other two men weigh \\(x\\) kg and \\(y\\) kg.\n4. The average weight is\n   \\[\n   \\frac{57+75+x+y}{4}\n   =\\frac{132+x+y}{4}.\n   \\]\n\nSince the weights of the other two men are not given, the average cannot be determined uniquely.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
